  "legal_privacy_title": "Privacy",
  "legal_privacy_heading": "Privacy Notice for the DFS Complaint App",
  "legal_privacy_0_title": "0. Scope",
  "legal_privacy_0_text_prefix": "These notes apply to the DFS Complaint App (web application for recording, processing and tracking complaints). They replace general website passages where the app is concerned. For content outside the app, please refer to the privacy policy published on our website: ",
  "legal_privacy_1_title": "1. Principle",
  "legal_privacy_1_text": "Data protection is of particular importance to DFS-Diamon GmbH. The app is generally accessible; a login is typically required for complaint handling features. Where no legal basis exists, we obtain consent. Processing is carried out in accordance with the GDPR and applicable laws.",
  "legal_privacy_2_title": "2. Definitions",
  "legal_privacy_2_text": "The terms used correspond to Art. 4 GDPR (e.g. personal data, processing, restriction of processing, pseudonymisation, controller, processor, recipient, third party, consent).",
  "legal_privacy_3_title": "3. Controller",
  "legal_privacy_3_text": "DFS-Diamon GmbH, Ländenstraße 1, D-93339 Riedenburg, Phone +49 (0) 9442 91 89-0 | Fax +49 (0) 9442 91 89-37, E-mail: info@dfs-diamon.de.",
  "legal_privacy_4_title": "4. Data Protection Officer",
  "legal_privacy_4_text": "Michael Gruber, BSP-SECURITY, Thundorferstraße 10, D-93047 Regensburg, Tel. +49 (0) 941 46 29 09 29, info@bsp-security.de, https://bsp-security.de/",
  "legal_privacy_5_title": "5. Purposes and legal bases",
  "legal_privacy_5_text": "Purposes: registration/login, permission management; recording, processing and tracking of complaints; quality assurance, documentation, IT security; optional access/link to catalogue information (no product display/advertising in the app). Legal bases: Art. 6(1)(b) (contract/pre-contractual), Art. 6(1)(f) (legitimate interests – efficient complaint handling, IT security), Art. 6(1)(a) (consent, e.g. voluntary profile data or “stay signed in”).",
  "legal_privacy_6_title": "6. Categories of personal data",
  "legal_privacy_6_text": "Master data (name, salutation, company/customer no., contact, language/country), case data (ticket, category, description, status/decision, timestamps), usage/technical data (logs, IP address, browser/OS, session/JWT).",
  "legal_privacy_7_title": "7. Technically required storage (no tracking in the app)",
  "legal_privacy_7_text": "The app does not use tracking cookies or Google Analytics. For authentication/sessions, technically required tokens (e.g. JWT) are stored in the browser (LocalStorage/SessionStorage) and removed on logout or expiry. When opening external catalogue pages, their privacy policies apply.",
  "legal_privacy_8_title": "8. Hosting, recipients and third-country transfers",
  "legal_privacy_8_text": "The app is operated on behalf of DFS-Diamon GmbH. Processors are contractually bound under Art. 28 GDPR. Data is not shared with third parties unless legally required or necessary for contract performance. Where services outside the EU/EEA are used, this is based on Art. 44 et seq. GDPR (e.g. SCCs) with supplementary safeguards.",
  "legal_privacy_9_title": "9. Logging/Server logs",
  "legal_privacy_9_text": "On access, IP address, date/time, requested resources/status codes and browser/OS may be logged. Purpose: operational security, troubleshooting, detection and defence against misuse/attacks (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Short-term retention, then deletion/anonymisation unless longer storage is required for evidence.",
  "legal_privacy_10_title": "10. Registration/Account",
  "legal_privacy_10_text": "A registration/login is required for complaint features. Mandatory fields are marked. For security, time and IP are stored upon registration/login (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Accounts can be deleted upon request unless retention obligations apply.",
  "legal_privacy_11_title": "11. Communication",
  "legal_privacy_11_text": "When contacting us via the app (or by e-mail), we process the transmitted data to handle the request (Art. 6(1)(b)/(f) GDPR). Data is not shared with third parties unless there is a legal obligation.",
  "legal_privacy_12_title": "12. Retention",
  "legal_privacy_12_text": "We process personal data only as long as necessary for the respective purposes or as long as legal retention periods apply. Afterwards, data is deleted or anonymised.",
  "legal_privacy_13_title": "13. Data subject rights",
  "legal_privacy_13_text": "Rights under Art. 15–22 GDPR (access, rectification, erasure, restriction, data portability, objection). You may lodge a complaint with the Bavarian Data Protection Authority (BayLDA). Contact: info@dfs-diamon.de or the Data Protection Officer.",
  "legal_privacy_14_title": "14. Automated decisions/Profiling & changes",
  "legal_privacy_14_text": "No solely automated decisions and no profiling take place in the app. We may update these notes (technical changes, new requirements or feature extensions such as a future catalogue view). The current version is available in the app.",
  "legal_privacy_link_label": "Website privacy policy:",
  "legal_privacy_stand_prefix": "Version:",

  "imprint_title": "Legal Notice",
  "imprint_publisher_title": "Publisher",
  "imprint_publisher_body": "DFS-Diamon GmbH\nLändenstraße 1\nD - 93339 Riedenburg, Germany\n\nPhone +49 (0) 9442 91 89-0\nFax +49 (0) 9442 91 89-37\nE-mail info@dfs-diamon.de",
  "imprint_register_title": "Company Register",
  "imprint_register_body": "Local Court Regensburg HRB 2966\nVAT ID No. DE 128580122\n\nContent responsible: Dr. Stefan Brand\nAuthorized representative: Dr. Stefan Brand",
  "imprint_disclaimer_title": "Disclaimer",
  "imprint_disclaimer_body": "We make every effort to provide accurate and complete information on this website, but we assume no liability or guarantee for the timeliness, accuracy or completeness of the information provided. This also applies to all external links to which this website refers directly or indirectly. We are not responsible for the content of external websites accessed via such links. All information on prices, product texts and images is provided without warranty; errors and technical changes reserved.",
  "imprint_copyright_title": "Copyright",
  "imprint_copyright_body": "All rights reserved. The content and structure of the DFS-Diamon website are protected by copyright. Information or data (text, images, graphics, audio, video or animation files) from our website may not be used or reproduced, in whole or in part, without prior written consent from DFS-Diamon GmbH.",
